id: E551-draft-CCD4
trigger_tool: configure|make|clang|autotools|consumer execution
phase: configuration|compilation|testing
error_signature: "SDL\.h: No such file|fatal error: SDL\.h|make check.*No such file|command not found: exult|command not found: expack|command not found: ipack"
severity: 2
category: ohos, autotools, headers, consumer
match_keywords: Exult, SDL2, SDL.h, Autotools, OHOS, consumer test
prescan_pattern: "#include[[:space:]]*[<\"]SDL\\.h[>\"]"
title: Exult OHOS Autotools 配方的 SDL2 头文件与消费者验证
root_cause: Exult 源码直接包含 SDL.h，而 SDL2 Conan 包通常将头文件安装在 include/SDL2；同时 OHOS 交叉编译需要显式 build/host triplet，安装后的命令行工具必须通过消费者测试实际调用。
affected_scope: 使用 Conan SDL2 的 Autotools C/C++ 应用，尤其是需要在 OHOS aarch64 上构建并安装多个命令行工具的项目。
verification_cmd: "conan create archives/e/exult/1.12.1 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing && bash test_package/test.sh"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: autotools-ohos-sdl2-header-and-consumer-validation
rec_description: 使用 AutotoolsToolchain 注入 SDL2/include/SDL2，OHOS 构建时设置 aarch64-linux-ohos build/host，并在 test_package 中执行每个安装的命令验证输出和文档规定的退出码。
rec_command: "tc.extra_cxxflags.append(f'-I{self.dependencies[\"sdl2\"].package_folder}/include/SDL2'); tc.configure_args.extend(['--build=aarch64-linux-ohos', '--host=aarch64-linux-ohos'])"
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: recipe-edit
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: inspect-package-layout
fallback_description: 若 SDL2 头文件布局或工具行为不同，先检查 Conan package_folder 和命令帮助输出，再按实际路径与退出码更新配方测试。
fallback_command: "find $CONAN_SDL2_PACKAGE/include -name SDL.h; command --help"
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: manual
forbid_1_pattern: "-I/usr/local|SDL\\.h.*只打印|make check.*计为.*测试用例"
forbid_1_reason: 不能依赖共享系统路径、空壳消费者测试或把递归构建检查虚增为上游测试用例。
forbid_1_consequence: CI 环境可能找不到 SDL2 头文件，或测试报告夸大上游覆盖率。
principles: P003, P007, P018
causes: []
caused_by: []
similar_to: []
conflicts_with: []
prerequisite_of: []
